::  name       skate ring admit gate
::  shape      occupancy - int (@u32) -> lawful - int (@u32)
::  invariant  answers 1 while occupancy leaves a seat free (0..127 used); answers 0 at the full ring
::  example    5 -> 1 · 128 -> 0
::  readers    Skate · the native surface · Glow
::  nib        loca-skate-binding-v0 · the ring's Full wall in Glow (20260829)
::
::  The event ring owns 128 fixed seats and refuses the 129th event without
::  eviction -- Rye's wall is event_capacity = 128 in
::  brushstroke/skate_event_ring.rye, proven from both sides the day the ring
::  was ported and again inside a booted iPhone. This gate speaks the same
::  admission in Glow: a push finding `sample` seats already used is lawful
::  while sample stays under the capacity.
|=  sample=@u32
?:  (gth sample 127)  0  1
